<title>SRI LANKA: Colombo exchange begins screen based trading trial.</title>
<headline>Colombo exchange begins screen based trading trial.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Colombo Stock Exchange will begin testing its screen-based trading system during trading hours from Tuesday, a senior exchange official said.</p>
<p>&quot;We begin a transitional phase today when the screen-based trading system will be tested during trading hours,&quot; said Dylan Moldrich, director-general of the stock exchange.</p>
<p>&quot;We hope to formally start screen-based trading within two weeks, provided the system has been fully tested during this transitional phase,&quot; he added.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
